(Definition 2 (Reflection sequence)) Tj
0 -16 Td
/F3 11 Tf
(For a tagged ATP M, put theta0^M := ATP(<M>), and recursively theta-n+1^M := Pr(<M>,<theta-n^M>).) Tj
